Z||000000||BlackDragon||12-10-2001||01:53 PM||||i just rebuilt my duke, it runs now, but it runs realy rich and almost floods. i have a new injector, throtle position sensor, fuel pump, and oxygen sensor. what do i need to buy next? someone suggested map sensor, is this a good idea? what should i try next? any help would be appreciated. thanks <P>------------------<BR>riced civics suck||||reg||1
Z||000001||GTDude||12-10-2001||03:41 PM||||check to see that you have good vacuum going to the map sensor at idle first.  If you do then i'd try a map sensor.  Or if you can have someone scan the system....see what the voltage readings are with key on engine off and at idle.  Should be about 4v koeo and something under 2v at idle.  <P>------------------<BR>||||reg||1
